(7529025, 1203773, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not only scenically beautiful, it''s a visual pleasure to trace the rivers threading down into and across the lowlands and into the larger river.  Also the descending lines of hills and mountains. Sumptuous.  A co-favorite.</td>', 'Not only scenically beautiful, it''s a visual pleasure to trace the rivers threading down into and across the lowlands and into the larger river.  Also the descending lines of hills and mountains. Sumptuous.  A co-favorite.', '2017-08-15 16:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529026, 1203569, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the whole feel of this image, the lightness of touch.  The modest line of fence posts mysteriously drops out of sight into a ravine or valley, drawing the imagination forward.  The composition is elegant, the sepia and vignetting bear up the mood.  And of course the whimsical cloud rabbit flashing out of the image --  that''s a lot to come together.  A co-favorite.</td>', 'I like the whole feel of this image, the lightness of touch.  The modest line of fence posts mysteriously drops out of sight into a ravine or valley, drawing the imagination forward.  The composition is elegant, the sepia and vignetting bear up the mood.  And of course the whimsical cloud rabbit flashing out of the image --  that''s a lot to come together.  A co-favorite.', '2017-08-15 16:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529027, 1203772, 173844, '<td valign="top">A cornucopia of leading lines going off in all directions, moving the eye hither and thither.  A nice feeling of imbalance, as if you''ve just gotten off a roller coaster.  Very interesting.</td>', 'A cornucopia of leading lines going off in all directions, moving the eye hither and thither.  A nice feeling of imbalance, as if you''ve just gotten off a roller coaster.  Very interesting.', '2017-08-15 16:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529028, 1203779, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love the clean lines and sharp graphic design.  The leading line is short, like an apostrophe, but certainly to the point.  Happy to meet you.</td>', 'I love the clean lines and sharp graphic design.  The leading line is short, like an apostrophe, but certainly to the point.  Happy to meet you.', '2017-08-15 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529029, 1203824, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lush, dramatic scene with leading filaments and a leading zig-zag.  What I first took for water now looks like clouds.  Pleasantly baffling.  A lovely image.</td>', 'A lush, dramatic scene with leading filaments and a leading zig-zag.  What I first took for water now looks like clouds.  Pleasantly baffling.  A lovely image.', '2017-08-15 17:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529031, 1203416, 173844, '<td valign="top">These lines don''t lead you forward, they powerfully shove you through this tunnel to that light at the end of it.  Black and white is a fine choice.  Very nice.</td>', 'These lines don''t lead you forward, they powerfully shove you through this tunnel to that light at the end of it.  Black and white is a fine choice.  Very nice.', '2017-08-15 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529032, 1203694, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lines of river or ocean pilings are frequently depicted, but these are presented uncommonly well.  The soft colors seem to be melting into night.  I like the generous dark foreground that allows the morning/twilight to emerge.</td>', 'Lines of river or ocean pilings are frequently depicted, but these are presented uncommonly well.  The soft colors seem to be melting into night.  I like the generous dark foreground that allows the morning/twilight to emerge.', '2017-08-15 17:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529033, 1203842, 173844, '<td valign="top">A jaunty image of a fun, retro-feeling scene.  Though roof lines suffice, I''m going to assume that what''s important here is the cloud or contrail line coming down from the sky like a blessing upon the "interesting" figure.  Nice composition.  I, too, am smiling.</td>', 'A jaunty image of a fun, retro-feeling scene.  Though roof lines suffice, I''m going to assume that what''s important here is the cloud or contrail line coming down from the sky like a blessing upon the "interesting" figure.  Nice composition.  I, too, am smiling.', '2017-08-15 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529034, 1203695, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-modulated and balanced scene.  I love the colors in the sky.  The only thing that feels off is the titular craft.</td>', 'Well-modulated and balanced scene.  I love the colors in the sky.  The only thing that feels off is the titular craft.', '2017-08-15 17:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529035, 1203847, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light and dark.  The lines of the pews seem to be yearning for the light, yet you treat this aspect with great restraint.  Simple, but so much here, brimming with life.</td>', 'Wonderful use of light and dark.  The lines of the pews seem to be yearning for the light, yet you treat this aspect with great restraint.  Simple, but so much here, brimming with life.', '2017-08-15 17:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529036, 1203798, 173844, '<td valign="top">Whoa, them''s some leading lines!  Powerful architectural elements has you feeling like you''re whipping through a particle accelerator.  Really neat image.</td>', 'Whoa, them''s some leading lines!  Powerful architectural elements has you feeling like you''re whipping through a particle accelerator.  Really neat image.', '2017-08-15 17:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529038, 1203840, 173844, '<td valign="top">So minimal yet so very pleasing.  The leading lines of the cables are terrifically dizzying.  Has the feel of an intricate musical instrument, a wind harp.  A great example of more being done with less.</td>', 'So minimal yet so very pleasing.  The leading lines of the cables are terrifically dizzying.  Has the feel of an intricate musical instrument, a wind harp.  A great example of more being done with less.', '2017-08-15 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529040, 1203687, 173844, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image. Perfectly aslant.  The street line, the walls, solid and of cross-hatched columns, the light, the shadows, the glint of water, the receding figure --  marvelously come together.  So, a third co-favorite.</td>', 'A wonderful image. Perfectly aslant.  The street line, the walls, solid and of cross-hatched columns, the light, the shadows, the glint of water, the receding figure --  marvelously come together.  So, a third co-favorite.', '2017-08-15 17:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529042, 1203796, 173844, '<td valign="top">Engrossing, highly satisfying image.  Such a quirky, meandering leading line.  Fascinating composition and balance.  So many fine black and whites in this challenge.</td>', 'Engrossing, highly satisfying image.  Such a quirky, meandering leading line.  Fascinating composition and balance.  So many fine black and whites in this challenge.', '2017-08-15 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529043, 1203809, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with a superlative leading line of sand cliffs.  Due appreciation is given to land, sea and sky.  Impressive.</td>', 'Beautiful image with a superlative leading line of sand cliffs.  Due appreciation is given to land, sea and sky.  Impressive.', '2017-08-15 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529044, 1203822, 173844, '<td valign="top">Abundant leading lines in a deceptively simple, deftly composed image.  The modest colors are sparked by that central red object, which looks like a robot gazing into the distance.  A tour de force.</td>', 'Abundant leading lines in a deceptively simple, deftly composed image.  The modest colors are sparked by that central red object, which looks like a robot gazing into the distance.  A tour de force.', '2017-08-15 18:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529047, 1203807, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good expression of leading lines.  I also like the contrast of green and gray.</td>', 'Good expression of leading lines.  I also like the contrast of green and gray.', '2017-08-15 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529048, 1203816, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic perspective.  I like how the dead leaves are strewn about, especially as they intermingle with the greenery.</td>', 'Classic perspective.  I like how the dead leaves are strewn about, especially as they intermingle with the greenery.', '2017-08-15 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7529049, 1203384, 173844, '<td valign="top">Smooth downward flow, nice complexity.</td>', 'Smooth downward flow, nice complexity.', '2017-08-15 18:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
