(7529063, 1203780, 173844, '<td valign="top">A festival of leading lines, great variety of shapes and strong colors.  Though  tracks usually lead one''s eyes into the distance, here the onrushing train kind of reverses expectations.  Which is fun.</td>', 'A festival of leading lines, great variety of shapes and strong colors.  Though  tracks usually lead one''s eyes into the distance, here the onrushing train kind of reverses expectations.  Which is fun.', '2017-08-15 19:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
