(7529139, 1203852, 68504, '<td valign="top">beautiful counterpoint and harmonies. my fingers are a''tappin''. (blue channel works well here; usually it is too heavy. for me anyway). 56 out of 59. well, what else is new.</td>', 'beautiful counterpoint and harmonies. my fingers are a''tappin''. (blue channel works well here; usually it is too heavy. for me anyway). 56 out of 59. well, what else is new.', '2017-08-16 02:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
