(7529277, 1203695, 12611, '<td valign="top">This here one was the best of the bunch. The range of colors and light is just way more pleasing to my untrained eye than any other shot in the challenge... and the wacky God''s Love inclusion seals the deal!</td>', 'This here one was the best of the bunch. The range of colors and light is just way more pleasing to my untrained eye than any other shot in the challenge... and the wacky God''s Love inclusion seals the deal!', '2017-08-16 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7529278, 1203788, 12611, '<td valign="top">This would make a hell of a print in some lodge in Aspen...</td>', 'This would make a hell of a print in some lodge in Aspen...', '2017-08-16 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7529279, 1203153, 12611, '<td valign="top">The fountain distorting the buildings, juxtaposed with the lens flare, is just terrific. And as always, you tweak the viewer''s perspective with the POV of someone facing the other way, in this instance the unmistakable nod to the white suited dandy...</td>', 'The fountain distorting the buildings, juxtaposed with the lens flare, is just terrific. And as always, you tweak the viewer''s perspective with the POV of someone facing the other way, in this instance the unmistakable nod to the white suited dandy...', '2017-08-16 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7529280, 1203847, 12611, '<td valign="top">My take on this- or at least what I feel is a great sense of emotion, the feeling, or allegory perhaps, of being bent and head down in prayer, introspectively, and the feeling of following the sun, coming up for air, seeing a different perspective <i>outside</i> of the Church. The theme of  constant search for truth, or at least some sort of enlightment, from a non-traditional or perhaps even heresy, of Nature over the human construct and confines of organized religion and preconceived notions of the proper path to God...<br/> <br/>(or maybe its just nice light and a good composition!)</td>', 'My take on this- or at least what I feel is a great sense of emotion, the feeling, or allegory perhaps, of being bent and head down in prayer, introspectively, and the feeling of following the sun, coming up for air, seeing a different perspective outside of the Church. The theme of  constant search for truth, or at least some sort of enlightment, from a non-traditional or perhaps even heresy, of Nature over the human construct and confines of organized religion and preconceived notions of the proper path to God... (or maybe its just nice light and a good composition!)', '2017-08-16 11:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7529281, 1203843, 12611, '<td valign="top">Such terrific depth, and those trees and greenery just pop out... Viva la smartphone!</td>', 'Such terrific depth, and those trees and greenery just pop out... Viva la smartphone!', '2017-08-16 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7529282, 1203822, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love this one. So simple it lets the mind wander. I personally got the feel of an authoritarian dystopian future, full of grey skies and fences, where color is coveted and seen as the resistance.(but maybe I had too much caffeine)</td>', 'I love this one. So simple it lets the mind wander. I personally got the feel of an authoritarian dystopian future, full of grey skies and fences, where color is coveted and seen as the resistance.(but maybe I had too much caffeine)', '2017-08-16 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
