(7529367, 1203695, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by blindjustice:</b></div><hr/><i> This here one was the best of the bunch. The range of colors and light is just way more pleasing to my untrained eye than any other shot in the challenge... and the wacky God''s Love inclusion seals the deal! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Paul, I appreciate the comment.  I had other shorter exposures with that little skiff more in focus but think this one was the stronger image.</td>', 'Originally posted by blindjustice: This here one was the best of the bunch. The range of colors and light is just way more pleasing to my untrained eye than any other shot in the challenge... and the wacky God''s Love inclusion seals the deal!   Thanks Paul, I appreciate the comment.  I had other shorter exposures with that little skiff more in focus but think this one was the stronger image.', '2017-08-17 09:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
