(7530250, 1203710, 104230, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot Micheal.  Many congratulations. It''s such fun following your and Deb''s amazing travels.<br/> <br/>PS. From this angle it feels as if taking the road on the left would lead to a "walking the plank" situation!</td>', 'What a beautiful shot Micheal.  Many congratulations. It''s such fun following your and Deb''s amazing travels. PS. From this angle it feels as if taking the road on the left would lead to a "walking the plank" situation!', '2017-08-22 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7530562, 1203848, 96664, '<td valign="top">I think this one got is a pretty accurate score. Couple things here, I think that a lot of people expected to see leading lines a little different than you portrayed here which probably cost you some points... This bring me to the main reason I think this score pretty low... DPC for some unknown reason HATES this gritty style of editing. Honestly, I''m surprised you got this score with this style of editing. It''s definitely not the people''s choice around here... It did better than most other images done in this style... Keep that in mind.</td>', 'I think this one got is a pretty accurate score. Couple things here, I think that a lot of people expected to see leading lines a little different than you portrayed here which probably cost you some points... This bring me to the main reason I think this score pretty low... DPC for some unknown reason HATES this gritty style of editing. Honestly, I''m surprised you got this score with this style of editing. It''s definitely not the people''s choice around here... It did better than most other images done in this style... Keep that in mind.', '2017-08-23 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7530574, 1203848, 123833, '<td valign="top">At DPC the entries must be close to the subject, these are not leading lines</td>', 'At DPC the entries must be close to the subject, these are not leading lines', '2017-08-23 16:28:20.000000', NULL, 0);
